      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#888888>[STATIC HISS]</color>


    <b>UNIT 4-CHARLIE:</b>

    <i>"Dispatch, 4-Charlie! We''ve lost the 5th Street barricade! They are not stopping! I repeat, shooting them in the chest does nothing! They just keep coming!"</i>


    <color=#888888>[HEAVY STRUGGLE / THUD]</color>


    <b>DISPATCH (CALM):</b>

    <i>"4-Charlie, unrestricted lethal force is authorized. All units: Standard rules of engagement are suspended. Body shots will not stop them. You must destroy the brain. Aim for the head. Avoid all physical contact."</i>


    <color=#888888>[SIGNAL CUTS OUT]</color>'
